{"time": "20261117T172448Z", "think": "Quest ended; give notes.", "command": "answer 1. I got the first seal-stone from Blackrose by paying 300 gold toll to Corvus Ulvius and 1000 gold to Okaz-Teel for the vault key. I work for the Toh-Reel-Ka; three stones open the Kings Gate at Teku-Sul Spire to reach the Eye of Argonia and heal the Hist. 2. Fetch the other two stones: flooded vaults of Gemin (walk from Jal-Veesa, rootworm) and the deepest hall of Vorannuhl near Noota Nara (boat), then take all three to the gate at the Spire. 3. Either order; the Unbound race me for them. I have about 350 gold left. 4. Still unknown: why Cuts-the-Old-Knot seals trees she drains, what moans in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar, and how Nesh-Deeka knows the Unbound; I can look further at the fort and ask Nesh-Deeka.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Warden's Vault", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn14.vault-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1}, "gold": 650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "t